The models this choice loads are not bundled. openconsult install-speech
fetches them from their makers at the revisions pinned in
openconsult/speech/whisperx/models.json, into the model caches on the user's
computer: Whisper large-v3 and distil-large-v3 as converted by Systran (MIT),
the wav2vec2 alignment model of torchaudio (MIT), Silero VAD (MIT), and
pyannote's speaker-diarization-3.1, segmentation-3.0 (MIT, behind their
makers' terms on Hugging Face) and wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM (CC-BY-4.0).

